      <h1 class="jr-h1">Does Collagen Help Loose Skin After Weight Loss?</h1>
      <p class="jr-standfirst">You lost the weight and the skin did not follow. Here is what the biopsies show, what collagen peptides have actually been tested for, and what has better evidence.</p>

